sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant R as Reviews
  participant O as Orders
  participant S as Support
  participant OP as Operator
  C->>R: Submit review with customer token
  R->>O: Verify owned delivered order line (forward token)
  O-->>R: Minimal verified purchase fact
  R->>R: Store PENDING review
  OP->>R: Publish/reject/hide with reason
  C->>S: Open ticket / add message
  S->>O: Verify linked order ownership (forward token)
  O-->>S: Minimal verified order fact
  S->>S: Store owner-scoped ticket and audit
  OP->>S: Reply or transition with audit
